# Ownership and future review routing.
#
# While QueryGuard has a single maintainer, code-owner review is intentionally
# NOT required by the main branch ruleset: a solo maintainer cannot provide an
# independent approval. The paths below are split ahead of time so that adding a
# second maintainer is a one-line change rather than a governance redesign.
#
# See docs/decisions/0001-public-personal-repo.md.

*                                       @Benziza

/src/QueryGuard.Core/                   @Benziza
/src/QueryGuard.EntityFrameworkCore/    @Benziza
/src/QueryGuard.AspNetCore/             @Benziza
/src/QueryGuard.AspNetCore.Testing/     @Benziza
/src/QueryGuard.Testing/                @Benziza
/src/QueryGuard.Reporting/              @Benziza

/.github/workflows/                     @Benziza
/docs/decisions/                        @Benziza
